      "next_deadline": "Schedule the TEFRA hearing on a Board agenda with 7-day newspaper notice before the CDLAC application; for projects inside cities the city council holds the hearing (Daly City-style). No County issuer fee.",
      "prevailing_wage_trigger": "unclear",
      "layering_notes": "Plan on CMFA or CSCDA as issuer in Marin. Bonds alone do not trigger state prevailing wage; County Trust Fund, HOME or MHA money in the deal does. Sources opened: Board agendas of Oct 14, 2025 and Oct 20, 2026 on Granicus (the Oct 2025 staff report is image-only), Patch and Local News Matters coverage, and the CalHFA Marinwood Plaza listing in search results.",
